Package: kitJoin
Title: KIT Multi-Wave Data Join Tool
Version: 0.6.0
Date: 2026-10-31
Authors@R: person("KIT", "Join Tool", email = "joinkit@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shiny application for joining multi-wave survey data (CSV and
    SPSS SAV). Launch with \code{run_kitjoin()}. Supports wide joins by ID,
    long-format stacking, attrition flags, missing-value code conversion,
    post-join validation, and export to CSV or SAV. The interface is built
    with the shared KIT UI package kitDesign.
